$$<p>Kenya's Financial Reporting Centre has advertised 31 government jobs across 21 position categories, and applications close on 16 November 2026 at 5:00 pm East African Time. The vacancies were advertised in the MyGov newspaper on 27 October 2026, and applications must be submitted online through the Centre's official website. One point needs attention at the start: this is a Kenya government recruitment, and the report of the advertisement does not state a citizenship condition, so applicants should confirm eligibility in the full vacancy notice on the official website before applying. The report also states no salary figure for any post, so this article gives none.</p>
